    "summary": "Bearer: an **INFANTRY THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** or **MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** model.\n\nOnce per battle, for your whole army, when the bearer is **destroyed**, roll a D6 as the phase ends. On a 2+, set the bearer up on the battlefield again, **unengaged** and as near as it can be to the spot where it was **destroyed**. It forms a unit of its own, outside any **attached** unit, whose **starting strength** is 1, and it has 3 wounds left.",
